(This update brings head-office reporting across branches to the whole reporting suite: every report and the) Tj
T* (Reporting Dashboard can now be viewed for all branches consolidated, or narrowed to a single branch,) Tj
T* (and the dashboard's sales and inventory highlights now work at head office. It also adds at-a-glance) Tj
T* (dashboard tiles, a daily sales report, a new customers-by-sales view, and a commission monthly bundle) Tj
T* (download. Insight cards now deep-link directly to the relevant report tabs, and the sidebar opens to your) Tj
T* (first accessible group by default for faster navigation. The Sales Commission module defaults VAT to 15%,) Tj
T* (saving a manual step each month. On-screen help, clearer charts, and several accuracy and permission) Tj
T* (fixes round out the release. Every figure is drawn from, and reconciles to, Sage.) Tj
